# wallpaper1: black wallpapers = PosterBoard has no poster provider at all. Unified log of the phone (mirror 2026-11-13):
#   PosterBoard: 'extension point not found for query' x3 -> 'Extensions updated; Received 0 extensions' (every boot, 14 of 14);
