# This block (two independent ways to the same extension points, both undone by the undo):
#   1. sets enforce_xpc_cache_code_signing Enabled=false in the feature-flag plist (the file is then read as a plain plist);
#   2. writes /System/Library/ExtensionKit/ExtensionPoints/nord2-xpc-extension-points.appexpt = the extension points of
